my gentoo + sway config

Requires stowme <https://codeberg.org/key/stowme> which is a symlink manager
inspired by GNU stow, built to be integrated with git VCS and written fully
in Rust.

My stack

- Gentoo  <https://gentoo.org>
- Fuzzel  <https://codeberg.org/dnkl/fuzzel>
- Fnott   <https://codeberg.org/dnkl/fnott>
- Sway    <https://github.com/swaywm/sway>
- Bar     <https://tangled.org/roxylab.uk/keybar>
- Kitty   <https://github.com/kovidgoyal/kitty>
- Neovim  <https://github.com/neovim/neovim>
